      "writtenOn": "2020-02-25T22:23:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. The hope is that the reviewer won\u0027t get an email until the author is definitely ready for the reviewer to respond. I suppose the case could be made that repo upload should work this way by default.\n\nThe intended workflow, and I can clarify this if need be, is\n1. Receive comments on uploaded patchset.\n2. Fix things that need to be fixed.\n3. Uploaded new patchset with --ne.\n4. Reply to comments, saying that you fixed things or whatever, generating an email to the reviewer.",
      "parentUuid": "75e96771_1487d208",
